#~ msgid ""
#~ "Weather alerts come from the KDE Public Alert Server, not from government "
#~ "servers directly. Agencies like the NWS publish their official warnings "
#~ "as open CAP feeds. KDE's open-source server continuously aggregates "
#~ "hundreds of those feeds worldwide into one place, and the widget just "
#~ "asks for it. So you get the official alerts without contacting or "
#~ "revealing yourself to every agency that issues them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Погодні попередження надходять із сервера KDE Public Alert Server, а не "
